    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302">

                <pb facs="0421" n="315" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg315"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister is instructed to report any information he has relative to
                    indemnities on account of death or losses by the Lienchou <pb facs="0422"
                        n="316" xml:id="pg316"/> massacre, and to state whether any American
                    citizens have filed claims for indemnity on account thereof.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
